.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH GENETREE 1 2000-1月 "new" "new"
.SH NAME
new \- Create the GeneTree model from the ARACNE network and the gene expression matrix.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fInew(\fBaracne\fR as <generic> AracneNetwork, 
\fBexpr\fR as <generic> Matrix, 
\fBconfig\fR as <generic> GeneTreeConfig = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Create the GeneTree model from the ARACNE network and the gene expression matrix.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBaracne\fB \fR\- the ARACNE inferred network object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBexpr\fB \fR\- the gene expression matrix object(rows are genes, columns are samples).. 
.PP
.PP
\fBconfig\fB \fR\- the configuration object created by the \fBmake_profile\fR api.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the untrained [XGBoostGRN](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.XGBoostGRN) model object; an R# error message object
 is returned when the network or the expression matrix is invalid.
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
this function is the combination of the \fBload_topology\fR and the
 \fBload_expression\fR api, the model should be trained by the \fBfit_tree\fR api
 before any virtual perturbation experiment.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
geneTree
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
